<title>SAN MARINO: CYCLING-TONKOV WINS THIRD STAGE OF GIRO D'ITALIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TONKOV WINS THIRD STAGE OF GIRO D'ITALIA.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARINO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pavel Tonkov of Russia won the third stage of the Giro d'Italia on Monday, an 18 km individual time trial, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Yevgeny Berzin of Russia was second and Roberto Petito of Italy third.</p>
<p>Tonkov gained overall leadership.</p>
</text>
